Interpretation: the exact board-B firmware's handler at 0x8b14b524 returns
zero unconditionally. Disassembly at 0x8b14b5b0 is `move $v0, $zero`, followed
by `jr $ra`. These RPC results confirm CPU_COMM responsiveness only. They do
not report the private current-source field; see
docs/reference/cpu-comm-call-table.md, "SetSource(1) closed".
